{{define "content"}}
<article style="max-width: 800px;">
  <h1 class="mb-4">About resumebank.biz</h1>

  <p class="lead">
    resumebank.biz connects job seekers and employers directly, with searchable candidate and
    company profiles, job postings, and tools that help the right people find each other faster.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">For Candidates</h2>
  <p>
    Build a public profile with a rich-text resume, upload your PDF resume and supporting files, and
    get discovered by employers searching for your skills. Message employers directly, and give
    feedback on job postings with a thumbs up or down.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">For Employers</h2>
  <p>
    Create a company profile, post open positions, and search the candidate pool by keyword and
    skill. Message candidates you're interested in directly through the platform.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">AI-Assisted Matching</h2>
  <p>
    Paste a job description to get AI-suggested candidates, or paste a resume to get AI-suggested
    jobs, powered by a local semantic matching model. This feature is still in development and gets
    better as more candidates and jobs are added to the platform &mdash; treat its suggestions as a
    starting point, not a final answer.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Questions?</h2>
  <p>
    See our <a href="/terms">Terms and Conditions</a> for details on how the platform can be used.
  </p>
</article>
{{end}}

{{define "scripts"}}{{end}}
